Best Practice
we can use "TWO" stack to implement a queue
the idea is one stack is just for Enqueue, and we always just add item easily on him!
so the Enqueue is always O(1).
we have another stack for Dequeue, when we call Dequeue
we move all item from Enqueue stack to Dequeue stack by pop (so now the order is reversed)
now the Enqueue stack is empty and Dequeue stack has some items
we will add new items to Enqueue stack again
and we will use Dequeue stack to service the Dequeue service
when ever Dequeue service get empty, we will move Enqueue stack to Dequeue stack again!

